    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chelili anatuŋi delii mpwembu, ami nashuku dehi niyenzelu, akwakuhemba kuyisu, nawakwakwimba tumina, nawaLevi, anayikunjiki dehi kunyidimu yawu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hinukwinka mana kwami Hanani, nanguvuluwetala dakuhata Hananiya, mudimu wakutala Yerusalema, muloŋayena wadiŋi muntu walala, waakaminaŋa Nzambi chakubadika antu amavulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukuyila nami, Yenzelu yakuYerusalema bayi ayenzululaŋaku chiŋa mwaana busu; kwenzelaku chipa kunemani antu, akapataku ninyikomenu. Mwakakunjikapaku eniYerusalema akekalaŋa atulama, iwunahindi, iwu nahindi, wejima wawu kwatalaŋana namatalawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukalawelili nikutandumuka nikutoha, ilaŋa antu adiŋumu akeheli, nimatalakuyitupa nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi yami washili mumuchima wami jakupompesha atulamba nawanyuli niantu, kulonda akayisoneki mwahita nviyachi yawu. Nawenimukanda wanyiyachi yawu wenjili hakusambila, nawenumu asonekamunawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu anyana amuwuloŋu afumini muwuduŋu, akweti atweluwu, wowu atweliyi mwanta wakuBabiloni Nebukaneza, afuntili kuYerusalema nakuYuda, wejima wawu kunvikala yawu, kunyikala yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enjili naZerubabeli; Yeshuwa, Nehemiya, Azariya, Rayamiya, Nahamani, Modekayi, Bilishani, Misipereti, Biŋivayi, Nehumi, Bayana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwachindawu amayala awaIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaParoshi, makombakaji ayedi nankulakaji yimu namakumi atanu nayedi nawantu ayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaShefwatiya, makulakaji asatu namakumi atanu nayedi nawantu ayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaAra, makulakaji atanu nadimu namakumi atanu nawantuayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaPahatimowabi, akudi anyana kaYeshuwa naYowabi, makombakaji ayedi namakulakaji atanu nasatu nekumi natanu nasatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaElami, ikombakaji namakulakaji ayedi namakumi atanu nawantu awana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaZatu, makulakaji atanu nasatu namakumi awananawantu atanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaZakayi, makulakaji atanu nayedi namakumi atanu nadimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaBinuwi, makulakaji atanu nadimu namakumi awana nawantu atanu nasatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaBebayi, makulakaji atanu adimu namakumi ayedi natanu nasatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaAziŋadi, makomba aji ayedi namakulakaji asatu namakumi ayedi nayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaAdonitami, makulakaji atanu nadimu namakumi atanu nadimu nawantu atanu tayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaBigivayi, makombakaji ayedi namakumi atanuladimu nawantu atanu nayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaAdini, makulakaji atanuladimu namakumi atanu nawantu atanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaAteri, aHezekiya, nakumi atanu nawana nawantu atanu nasatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaHashumi, akulakaji asatu namakumi ayedi natanu nasatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaBezayi, rakulakaji asatu namakumi ayedi nawana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaHarifwi, nkulakaji nekumi nayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaGibeyoni, makumi atanu nawana nawantuatanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala akuBetelemi nakuNetofwa, nkulakaji namakumi atanu nasatu natanu nasatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala akuAnatoti, nkulakaji namakumi ayedi natanu nasatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala akuBetazimaveti, makumi awana nayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala akuKiriyati Yeyarimi nakuChefwira nakuBeyeroti, makulakaji atanu nayedi namakumi awana nasatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala akuRama nakuGeba, makulakaji atanu nadimu namakumi ayedi nawumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
