          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu afumini kuTelimela, nakuTeliharisha, nakuKerubi, nakuAdoni, nakulmeri; hiyatwesheli kushimuna mavumu awankakulula jawu helakwasemukawu, hela nawu, TuyaIsarelaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anyana kaDelaya, anyana kaTobiya, anyana kaNekoda, makulakaji atanu nadimu namakumi awananayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akudi atupristu; anyana kaHobaya, anyana kaHakozi, anyana kaBazilayi wasumbwili mumbanda kudi anyana kaBazilayi wakuGileyadi, atambwilakuni ijina dawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa akeŋakeŋeli majinawu kudi akwawu asonekawu nyiyachi, kuyimona nehi. Dichi hiyakuyifuukula nawu anajiloli, hiyakuyifumisha muwupristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nŋuvulu hakuyila nindi, Bayi mudyayasweja kujilaku chiŋa kwimana kapristu wukweti Wurimi naTumimi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.65"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
